            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "0-0",
                    "startTime": "00:00:11,862",
                    "endTime": "00:00:17,275",
                    "texts": [
                        "I've been called out by everybody for the ALS ice bucket challenge.\n大家都叫我参加渐冻症冰桶挑战。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "0-1",
                    "startTime": "00:00:17,375",
                    "endTime": "00:00:24,528",
                    "texts": [
                        "Simpson, Mike Tyson, Vince McMahon, like everybody's going crazy over this thing.\n辛普森、迈克泰森、文斯麦克马洪，好像每个人都为这件事疯狂。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "0-2",
                    "startTime": "00:00:24,628",
                    "endTime": "00:00:29,861",
                    "texts": [
                        "I guess they want to see whether or not it's my real hair which it is.\n我猜他们想看看这是不是我的真头发。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "0-3",
                    "startTime": "00:00:29,928",
                    "endTime": "00:00:31,687",
                    "texts": [
                        "So here's what I'm gonna do.\n所以这就是我要做的。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "0-4",
                    "startTime": "00:00:31,697",
                    "endTime": "00:00:35,713",
                    "texts": [
                        "Miss Universe and Miss USA, I own it.\n环球小姐和美国小姐，我都有。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "0-5",
                    "startTime": "00:00:35,723",
                    "endTime": "00:00:39,850",
                    "texts": [
                        "They're gonna really do a number on me.\n她们真的要对我下手了。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "0-6",
                    "startTime": "00:00:39,950",
                    "endTime": "00:00:46,818",
                    "texts": [
                        "I'm challenging president Obama, my son Donald, my son Eric.\n我要挑战总统奥巴马，我儿子唐纳德，我儿子埃里克。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "0-7",
                    "startTime": "00:00:46,918",
                    "endTime": "00:00:49,174",
                    "texts": [
                        "Let's go, ladies.\n开始吧，女士们。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "0-8",
                    "startTime": "00:00:55,394",
                    "endTime": "00:00:57,997",
                    "texts": [
                        "What a mess.\n糟了。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "1",
            "scene": "Home-家",
            "roles": [
                "Bill Gates-比尔盖茨"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "1-0",
                    "startTime": "00:01:00,586",
                    "endTime": "00:01:09,779",
                    "texts": [
                        "I'm here to join the people bringing attention to Lou Gehrig's disease by taking a ALS ice bucket challenge.\n我和大家一起，通过冰桶挑战引起人们对卢格里格氏症的关注。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "1-1",
                    "startTime": "00:01:10,079",
                    "endTime": "00:01:16,904",
                    "texts": [
                        "I'm going to challenge three more people, Elon Musk, Ryan Seacrest, Chris Anderson of TED.\n我要挑战三个人，伊隆·马斯克、主持人瑞安·西克雷斯特、TED的克里斯·安德森。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "1-2",
                    "startTime": "00:01:17,147",
                    "endTime": "00:01:19,462",
                    "texts": [
                        "Consider yourself challenged.\n接受挑战吧。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "1-3",
                    "startTime": "00:01:19,562",
                    "endTime": "00:01:24,045",
                    "texts": [
                        "You have 24 hours. Good luck.\n你有 24 小时时间。祝你好运。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ],
